linkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软发布 MAI-Image-2.7-Preview 图像编辑模型，位列全球榜单第二</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Opera推出WebAI标准，支持浏览器本地运行AI模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI计划采购谷歌自研AI芯片以实现算力供应链多元化布局</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌 DeepMind 发布 Genie 4 世界模型，支持音视频同步与实时交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6520c62495053d3cde024a8f9d0b3487.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌 DeepMind 正式发布新一代世界模型 Genie 4，该模型具备实时交互能力，单次连贯交互时长达 2 分钟。Genie 4 实现了空间一致性与永久记忆，支持用户通过输入实时调整天气或机位。作为首个原生支持音视频同步生成的世界模型，它能根据场景动态调整环境音效，并支持与 NPC 进行实时对话。技术架构上，Genie 4 采用双模型协同机制：Gemini Omni 负责维持角色与道具外观一致性，Gemini 3.8 Flash 担任实时导演进行逐帧审查，Gemini 4 Argon 则用于 Apollo 人形机器人的仿真训练。尽管在长时运行下的细节漂移及文字乱码问题仍待优化，但其交互性显著提升。目前该模型仅向受信任测试者开放，公众需通过每月 100 美元的 Google AI Ultra 会员资格排队申请</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁百灵开源Ling-3.1-flash-1019模型，强化Personal Agent真实任务处理能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/808c367587d4502d38f24a1dcc75a397.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">10月28日，蚂蚁集团百灵大模型正式开源Ling-3.1-flash-1019及基础模型Ling-3.1-flash-base。Ling-3.1-flash-1019在Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v4.3.2中获44分，重点优化了复杂工作流与多步骤任务表现，其中AutomationBench-AA得分提升至68%，CritPt得分提升至26%。Ling-3.1-flash-base采用混合线性MoE架构，总参数量约560B，激活参数约25B，在47项benchmark测试中表现优异，并以MIT许可证向开发者开放。该系列模型旨在支撑“灵光2.0”等Personal Agent场景，通过跨会话记忆与长程任务调度，实现从即时问答向持续任务管理的演进。百灵表示，研发重点</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布 MAI-Image-2.7-Preview 图像编辑模型，位列全球榜单第二</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/01085ad95cd164912a985aa3c5201748.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软于10月27日正式发布MAI-Image-2.7-Preview，该模型在Artificial Analysis图像编辑榜单中以1193 Elo分位列全球第二，仅次于OpenAI的GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst（max）。MAI-Image-2.7专注于可控图像编辑，用户通过输入原图及文字指令即可实现整体风格转换、重新打光、文字符号修改及复杂素材修复。相比2.6版本，新模型在全部10个用例及7类编辑动作上均有提升，特别是在场景与风格处理上领先次优模型24个Elo。目前，用户可通过Arena、Artificial Analysis及MAI Playground进行体验。作为预览版，该模型尚未开放API、定价及商用时间，模型权重亦未开源。微软官方表示，文生图功能目前处于“即将推出”阶段，具体上线日</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Opera推出WebAI标准，支持浏览器本地运行AI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f09eb7fefeceec77cf6adeaf98553836.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">浏览器制造商Opera正式发布全新网络标准WebAI，旨在实现AI模型在浏览器端的本地化运行，无需依赖云端服务。该标准具备广泛的兼容性，支持各类开放权重AI系统，目前已演示兼容谷歌Gemma模型及苹果设备端基础模型。WebAI现已在Opera One浏览器中开启预览，后续将扩展至Opera GX及Opera Neon。该技术支持文本生成、内容分类及信息关联分析。Opera表示，本地推理模式可减少对云端基础设施的依赖，并提升用户隐私保护水平，将数据留存在个人设备端。不过，该功能的实际性能表现高度依赖用户设备的硬件配置。WebAI的推出标志着Opera在浏览器端侧AI布局的进一步深入，旨在通过本地化运行平衡隐私保护与AI处理能力，为用户提供云端服务之外的替代方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI计划采购谷歌自研AI芯片以实现算力供应链多元化布局</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1e6ad108dfe19e2bc936f10c1c970f7d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正计划采购谷歌自研的人工智能芯片，旨在打破对单一算力供应商的依赖，加速推进硬件供应链的多元化布局。目前，该潜在交易的具体财务条款、采购规模及合作细节尚未对外披露。作为大模型领域的头部企业，OpenAI此前在算力构建上高度依赖传统芯片巨头与云服务商。此次拟采购谷歌AI芯片的举措，不仅标志着其在底层硬件设施策略上的重大调整，也反映了科技巨头在AI算力领域既竞争又合作的复杂态势。对于行业而言，此举可能重塑AI硬件市场的竞争格局，降低单一供应商风险，并推动高性能AI芯片市场的多元化发展。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
